nested configs
└── when checking a monorepo from the root
    ├── it routes each subtree with its own packs
    ├── it applies the nested check severities
    ├── it applies the nested uncovered severity
    ├── it ignores a broken root pack when checking only a nested subtree
    ├── it preserves the human output byte for byte
    ├── it emits a structured clean result
    ├── it emits structured findings and preserves the exit code
    ├── it emits todo findings and counts in JSON
    └── it emits JSON for setup failures
